= Practice: Integration by Parts

These problems are designed to build fluency and flexibility with Integration by Parts.

Compute each integral.

---

== Part I — Basic LIATE Practice

#enum(
  $ integral x e^x dif x $,
  $ integral x cos(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x sin(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x ln(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x^2 e^x dif x $,
  $ integral x^2 cos(x) dif x $
)

---

== Part II — Logarithmic and Inverse Trig

#enum(
  $ integral ln(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x ln(x) dif x $,
  $ integral arctan(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x arctan(x) dif x $,
  $ integral ln(x)^2 dif x $
)

---

== Part III — Repeated Integration by Parts

#enum(
  $ integral x^3 e^x dif x $,
  $ integral x^2 sin(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x^3 cos(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x^2 ln(x) dif x $
)

---

== Part IV — Cyclic Integrals

For these, you will need to apply Integration by Parts twice and solve algebraically.

#enum(
  $ integral e^x cos(x) dif x $,
  $ integral e^x sin(x) dif x $,
  $ integral e^(2x) cos(x) dif x $,
  $ integral e^(2x) sin(x) dif x $
)

---

== Part V — Definite Integrals

Evaluate exactly.

#enum(
  $ integral_0^1 x e^x dif x $,
  $ integral_0^(pi) x sin(x) dif x $,
  $ integral_1^e ln(x) dif x $,
  $ integral_0^1 x ln(x) dif x $
)

---

== Part VI — Challenge Problems

These require strong algebra and careful bookkeeping.

#enum(
  $ integral x^2 e^x cos(x) dif x $,
  $ integral x e^x sin(x) dif x $,
  $ integral ln(x) / x dif x $,
  $ integral x^2 ln(x)^2 dif x $
)